ess/audio/grounded-66.mp3"}, "Peace and happiness are inside of me. I can return to calm whenever I need it.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-65.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-65.mp3"}, "I don’t worry about things I cannot control. I release what is beyond me and tend to what is mine.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-67.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-67.mp3"}, "I have the strength to overcome any challenge. I meet hard moments with courage and persistence.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-69.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-69.mp3"}, "I am thankful for everything I have. Gratitude helps me recognize the richness already here.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-68.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-68.mp3"}, "I am safe and secure. I breathe into the support beneath and around me.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-70.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-70.mp3"}, "I know my potential. I trust what I can learn, create, and become.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-71.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-71.mp3"}, "I am so blessed. I pause to notice the gifts woven through my life.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-72.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-72.mp3"}, "Breathe out.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-74.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-74.mp3"}, "Breathe in.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-73.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-73.mp3"}, "Hold gently.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-75.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-75.mp3"}, "Return to your natural breath. Your session is complete.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-76.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-76.mp3"}, "Take a comfortable seat. Let your shoulders soften. Follow the circle at a pace that feels easy.": {"warm": "/wellness/audio/warm-77.mp3", "grounded": "/wellness/audio/grounded-77.mp3"}}